controller_or_repo_record|evidence|obs-evidence-head-ci-empty|[{"digest":"sha256:3e33addf358f486c39d72e01b6e9d13d025672f6ecabf4425453d29a4939e139","source_class":"repo_record","source_id":"plane-record","source_pointer":"plane-record.json#ci_frozen"}]|qodec-project: base_selected|1.0|The evidence head 04108e7 carries no CI run: check-runs 0, workflow runs 0, combined status pending — a frozen-empty result recorded from the plane-record, not inferred. Baseline 3ba3a38 and product head 940c7629 each have 11 check-runs, combined status success, 3 workflow runs.|current|["r21-evidence","oracle-topology"]
controller_or_repo_record|decision|obs-lock-supersession-chain|[{"digest":"sha256:14cfb81f5ea7b0fb567aec1f49a612040539f3a653ecb25218b09c102db62b76","source_class":"repo_record","source_id":"source-lock-v6","source_pointer":"SOURCE-LOCK-v6.yaml#supersession"}]|qodec-project: base_selected|1.0|SOURCE-LOCK v6 supersedes v5 (which mislabelled itself revision 4, left the reviewer digest disagreement open, and listed a publication decision among Round 0 blockers); v5 superseded v4 (whose reviewer run was recorded NOT RUN); v4 superseded v3 (which bound Round 0 to a tree that does not contain it, and whose parsers skipped malformed lines).|current|["supersession"]
controller_or_repo_record|constraint|obs-oracle-topology-constraint|[{"digest":"sha256:3e33addf358f486c39d72e01b6e9d13d025672f6ecabf4425453d29a4939e139","source_class":"repo_record","source_id":"plane-record","source_pointer":"plane-record.json#r21_evidence_material + evidence-head-chain"}]|qodec-project: base_selected|1.0|The chosen R21 constraint routes against what the oracle table targets, not against what it may target, with routing derived once and the ledger asked before the verdict. The evidence chain (16 commits 3ba3a38..04108e7) freezes the preservation run, its inputs, its allowed-outcomes envelope and its comparison.|current|["oracle-topology","r21-evidence"]
controller_or_repo_record|risk|obs-output-path-dependence|[{"digest":"sha256:14cfb81f5ea7b0fb567aec1f49a612040539f3a653ecb25218b09c102db62b76","source_class":"repo_record","source_id":"source-lock-v6","source_pointer":"SOURCE-LOCK-v6.yaml#output_identity"}]|qodec-project: base_selected|1.0|The profiler output embeds the literal input path, so any recorded expectation must name the path argument, not only the corpus; canonical arguments are 'chatgpt-export.json' and 'claude-session.window-r21.jsonl'. Recorded rather than fixed in this revision.|current|["measurement","oracle-topology"]
platform_capture|evidence|obs-plane-coder|[{"digest":"sha256:14cfb81f5ea7b0fb567aec1f49a612040539f3a653ecb25218b09c102db62b76","source_class":"repo_record","source_id":"source-lock-v6","source_pointer":"SOURCE-LOCK-v6.yaml#source_planes.plane-coder"}]|qodec-project: base_selected|1.0|plane-coder is the Claude Code coder session, frozen by record-prefix through record 17111 (17112 records, sha256 8392de80...); the whole-file digest is unstable (append-only), so only the prefix digest is authoritative.|current|["source-planes","measurement"]
controller_or_repo_record|decision|obs-profiler-fail-closed|[{"digest":"sha256:14cfb81f5ea7b0fb567aec1f49a612040539f3a653ecb25218b09c102db62b76","source_class":"repo_record","source_id":"source-lock-v6","source_pointer":"SOURCE-LOCK-v6.yaml#fail_closed_evidence"}]|qodec-project: base_selected,edge_witness_source|1.0|Both JSONL tools were hardened to fail closed on unreadable input; well-formed blobs reproduced every published count byte-for-byte, so the measurement contract is unchanged.|current|["measurement"]
controller_or_repo_record|decision|obs-repo-authority-04108e7|[{"digest":"sha256:3e33addf358f486c39d72e01b6e9d13d025672f6ecabf4425453d29a4939e139","source_class":"repo_record","source_id":"plane-record","source_pointer":"plane-record.json#PR16+evidence_head_04108e7"}]|qodec-project: base_selected|1.0|The authoritative record of R21 acceptance is the frozen plane-record — evidence head 04108e7 with its frozen CI and evidence artifacts and PR #16 state — not the reviewer's relayed acceptance. Product head is 940c7629; PR #16 is open, draft, unmerged.|current|["r21-evidence","product-integration","oracle-topology"]
deterministic_derivative|evidence|obs-reviewer-digest-disagreement|[{"digest":"sha256:14cfb81f5ea7b0fb567aec1f49a612040539f3a653ecb25218b09c102db62b76","source_class":"repo_record","source_id":"source-lock-v6","source_pointer":"SOURCE-LOCK-v6.yaml#reviewer_digest_disagreement"}]|qodec-project: base_selected|1.0|The one value that did not reproduce was the reviewer profile digest; the exact cause is the literal input path serialised into the report ('/tmp/chatgpt-export.json' vs 'chatgpt-export.json', a five-byte diff on one field), with zero differing measured values. Status CLOSED.|current|["measurement"]
